# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATA POLICY (read this): this is a PUBLIC-FACING package.
# NEVER commit a real customer harness definition. A real harness's geometry
# may be the customer's intellectual property. Only SYNTHETIC examples using
# FICTIONAL part numbers belong in examples/.
#
# As a guard, all .hns files are ignored by default EXCEPT those explicitly
# placed under examples/ (which must be synthetic). If you add a real .hns
# anywhere for local testing, it will be ignored — keep it that way.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.hns
!examples/*.hns

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
